From 05f96e1bbe811739f4d3ac8a3926745925a97c3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gambot <56745325+GbotHQ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 11:06:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] locale: name the CJK fonts by the families they actually
 contain

preference_ja/zh/ko.txt asked for `NotoJP`, `NotoCN` and `NotoKO`. Those strings appear
nowhere in the shipped fonts: the families inside data/fonts/NotoJP.ttf, NotoCN.ttf and
NotoKO.ttf are "Noto Serif JP", "Noto Serif SC" and "Noto Sans KR" (checked against every
name-table record, and against the whole file as bytes). Qt matches family names only, so
`QFont("NotoJP")`, `QFontDatabase::hasFamily("NotoJP")` and a QSS `font-family: NotoJP`
all fall through to the default font - silently, because QWidget::font().family() still
echoes the requested string.

Use the real family names.

Two things this does NOT settle, deliberately left to the maintainer:

  * All three files are variable fonts whose only reachable instance is ExtraLight (JP,
    SC) or Thin (KR), so the UI would render hairline unless QFont::setVariableAxis is
    used or proper instances are shipped.
  * JP and SC are Serif faces bundled into an interface whose own font is the sans Geist.
---
 data/locale/preference_ja.txt | 6 +++---
 data/locale/preference_ko.txt | 6 +++---
 data/locale/preference_zh.txt | 6 +++---
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/data/locale/preference_ja.txt b/data/locale/preference_ja.txt
index 978f28b..7c69281 100644
--- a/data/locale/preference_ja.txt
+++ b/data/locale/preference_ja.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
-font_family = NotoJP
-font_family_win = NotoJP
-font_family_mac = NotoJP
+font_family = Noto Serif JP
+font_family_win = Noto Serif JP
+font_family_mac = Noto Serif JP
 font_size = 12pt
 font_size_win = 12pt
 font_size_mac = 14pt
diff --git a/data/locale/preference_ko.txt b/data/locale/preference_ko.txt
index 36f815c..1b797b0 100644
--- a/data/locale/preference_ko.txt
+++ b/data/locale/preference_ko.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
-font_family = NotoKO
-font_family_win = NotoKO
-font_family_mac = NotoKO
+font_family = Noto Sans KR
+font_family_win = Noto Sans KR
+font_family_mac = Noto Sans KR
 font_size = 12pt
 font_size_win = 12pt
 font_size_mac = 14pt
diff --git a/data/locale/preference_zh.txt b/data/locale/preference_zh.txt
index 44b6037..a29b554 100644
--- a/data/locale/preference_zh.txt
+++ b/data/locale/preference_zh.txt
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
-font_family = NotoCN
-font_family_win = NotoCN
-font_family_mac = NotoCN
+font_family = Noto Serif SC
+font_family_win = Noto Serif SC
+font_family_mac = Noto Serif SC
 font_size = 12pt
 font_size_win = 12pt
 font_size_mac = 14pt
